<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independent English-first proposal. Repeated completion/to/brought spans are assigned clause by clause: first the three acts and desire, then mistaken views and ignorance. The later log lta owns the lowercase mistaken views in the reason clause. The entire long sexual-misconduct term is retained as a glossary-attested compound. rmongs pa owns lack of understanding; cher/deep-seated remains omitted because an intensive and a rootedness metaphor are not yet secure as an independent lexical pair. No uncertain nulls, source correction or hgm_gloss promotion.</div>
